[1.037715, "o", "\u001b[1;36m$ /Users/stevengonsalvez/.agents-in-a-box/worktrees/stevengonsalvez_agents-in-a-box_feat_multica/ainb-tui/target/debug/ainb hangar --help\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.131057, "o", "The `hangar` subcommand tree.\r\n\r\nThe single derive enum the registry's [`HangarCommand`](crate::cli::registry) augments onto the root `ainb` command. Each variant is a noun group whose inner enum carries the verbs.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[4mUsage:\u001b[0m \u001b[1mainb hangar\u001b[0m [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[4mCommands:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1missue\u001b[0m   Manage Hangar issues\r\n  \u001b[1mtask\u001b[0m    Inspect and control Hangar tasks\r\n  \u001b[1mbeads\u001b[0m   Sync Hangar issues with the beads (`bd`) tracker\r\n  \u001b[1mdaemon\u001b[0m  Inspect the Hangar control-plane daemon\r\n  \u001b[1mhelp\u001b[0m    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[4mOptions:\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1m--format\u001b[0m <format>\r\n          Output format\r\n          \r\n          [default: text]\r\n          [possible values: text, json, csv, markdown]\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m-h\u001b[0m, \u001b[1m--help\u001b[0m\r\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\r\n"]
